{
    "title": "Music Recognition - Find Songs",
    "description": "Music Recognition will identify any song in seconds.It\u00b4s very simple and easy to use.\r\n\r\nMusic Recognition lets you play a music preview of the identified track and give you the option to listen the full song on Spotify and Youtube streaming services. \r\n\r\nMusic Recognition & Song Finder is a music song detector identifies the song you are listening to in a few seconds in real time and shows the song's title and singer by providing links to listen to the song recognized on the most popular streaming music services.\r\n\r\nFeatures of song identifier\r\n* Find a song by humming\r\n* Find the name of any song in seconds.\r\n* Find song by sound within seconds (Powered by ACRCloud).\r\n* Song search by humming,listen and add to Music playlists.\r\n* Music finder by sound,watch music videos from Spotify Music or YouTube.\r\n* Use Pop-up Song Recognizer to identify music in any app - Instagram, YouTube, TikTok.\r\n* Listen to a spotify preview of the song so you can be sure it matches what you found.\r\n* Get recommended songs and playlists to discover new music.\r\n* Share songs with friends through Snapchat, Facebook, WhatsApp, Instagram, Twitter and more.\r\n\r\nEvery identified song is saved in the history page,you'll have a Music Map to look up exactly where you heard that song you loved so much. You can also connect your Spotify account to build playlists, explore music across genres.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>music recognition by link</b>\u3011\r\n* paste the link to identify song names.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>music identifier</b>\u3011\r\n* Local video recognition of song names.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>Pop-up Music Recognition</b>\u3011\r\n* Pop-up Music Recognition to identify music in any app - Instagram, YouTube, TikTok.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>music chart</b>\u3011\r\n* Find out what is popular in your country or city with music charts.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>top hits</b>\u3011\r\n* Get recommended songs and playlists to discover new music.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>my playlist</b>\u3011\r\n* Create playlists with song suggestions or collaborate with other music fans to create the perfect playlist.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>my favourite song</b>\u3011\r\n* Personalized playlists and Mixes made just for you, built around your favorite types of music.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>go to spotify</b>\u3011\r\n* Open any song directly in Spotify.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>youtube videos</b>\u3011\r\n* Watch music videos from YouTube.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>spotify preview</b>\u3011\r\n* Listen to a preview of the song so you can be sure it matches what you found.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>download music</b>\u3011\r\n* Free music download,download albums, playlists, or just that one song and listen to music offline, wherever you are.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>Ringtone Maker</b>\u3011\r\n* How to use this Ringtone Cutter:\r\n* 1. Choose a music clip from your phone/ SD card\r\n* 2. Select the length of the music you want to cut out and trim music\r\n* 3. Edit tag for the clip(Title, Format, Bitrate, Volume etc)\r\n* 4. Save as Ringtone/Alarm/Notification or Share\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>song search</b>\u3011\r\n* Perfect search feature will help to easily find your favorite songs.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>mp4 to mp3</b>\u3011\r\n* You can convert video to MP3 and convert video to audio with this free MP3 converter.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>share songs</b>\u3011\r\n* Share songs with friends through Snapchat, Facebook, WhatsApp, Instagram, Twitter and more.\r\n\r\n\u3010<b>playlist push</b>\u3011\r\n* Discover new music, albums, playlists.\r\n\r\nThank you for downloading Music Recognition - Song Finder. And your suggestions or problems are always welcomed. Please contact us at yikenshuigang@gmail.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Music Recognition will identify any song in seconds.It\u00b4s very simple and easy to use.<br><br>Music Recognition lets you play a music preview of the identified track and give you the option to listen the full song on Spotify and Youtube streaming services. <br><br>Music Recognition &amp; Song Finder is a music song detector identifies the song you are listening to in a few seconds in real time and shows the song&#39;s title and singer by providing links to listen to the song recognized on the most popular streaming music services.<br><br>Features of song identifier<br>* Find a song by humming<br>* Find the name of any song in seconds.<br>* Find song by sound within seconds (Powered by ACRCloud).<br>* Song search by humming,listen and add to Music playlists.<br>* Music finder by sound,watch music videos from Spotify Music or YouTube.<br>* Use Pop-up Song Recognizer to identify music in any app - Instagram, YouTube, TikTok.<br>* Listen to a spotify preview of the song so you can be sure it matches what you found.<br>* Get recommended songs and playlists to discover new music.<br>* Share songs with friends through Snapchat, Facebook, WhatsApp, Instagram, Twitter and more.<br><br>Every identified song is saved in the history page,you&#39;ll have a Music Map to look up exactly where you heard that song you loved so much. You can also connect your Spotify account to build playlists, explore music across genres.<br><br>\u3010<b>music recognition by link</b>\u3011<br>* paste the link to identify song names.<br><br>\u3010<b>music identifier</b>\u3011<br>* Local video recognition of song names.<br><br>\u3010<b>Pop-up Music Recognition</b>\u3011<br>* Pop-up Music Recognition to identify music in any app - Instagram, YouTube, TikTok.<br><br>\u3010<b>music chart</b>\u3011<br>* Find out what is popular in your country or city with music charts.<br><br>\u3010<b>top hits</b>\u3011<br>* Get recommended songs and playlists to discover new music.<br><br>\u3010<b>my playlist</b>\u3011<br>* Create playlists with song suggestions or collaborate with other music fans to create the perfect playlist.<br><br>\u3010<b>my favourite song</b>\u3011<br>* Personalized playlists and Mixes made just for you, built around your favorite types of music.<br><br>\u3010<b>go to spotify</b>\u3011<br>* Open any song directly in Spotify.<br><br>\u3010<b>youtube videos</b>\u3011<br>* Watch music videos from YouTube.<br><br>\u3010<b>spotify preview</b>\u3011<br>* Listen to a preview of the song so you can be sure it matches what you found.<br><br>\u3010<b>download music</b>\u3011<br>* Free music download,download albums, playlists, or just that one song and listen to music offline, wherever you are.<br><br>\u3010<b>Ringtone Maker</b>\u3011<br>* How to use this Ringtone Cutter:<br>* 1. Choose a music clip from your phone/ SD card<br>* 2. Select the length of the music you want to cut out and trim music<br>* 3. Edit tag for the clip(Title, Format, Bitrate, Volume etc)<br>* 4. Save as Ringtone/Alarm/Notification or Share<br><br>\u3010<b>song search</b>\u3011<br>* Perfect search feature will help to easily find your favorite songs.<br><br>\u3010<b>mp4 to mp3</b>\u3011<br>* You can convert video to MP3 and convert video to audio with this free MP3 converter.<br><br>\u3010<b>share songs</b>\u3011<br>* Share songs with friends through Snapchat, Facebook, WhatsApp, Instagram, Twitter and more.<br><br>\u3010<b>playlist push</b>\u3011<br>* Discover new music, albums, playlists.<br><br>Thank you for downloading Music Recognition - Song Finder. And your suggestions or problems are always welcomed. Please contact us at yikenshuigang@gmail.com.",
